Officers of the University

ORDINANCE VI OF 2000
IQRA UNIVERSITY ORDINANCE, 2000
ORDINANCE VI OF 2000
An
Ordinance to provide for the establishment, of a University at Karachi known as
the Iqra University
[Gazette of Sindh,
Extraordinary, Part I, 21st June,. 2000]
NO. S.LEGIS.I(VI)/2000, dated 21‑6‑2000.‑‑The
following Ordinance made by the Governor of Sindh is hereby published for
general information:‑‑
4. Officers of the University.‑‑The
following shall be the officers of the University:‑‑‑
(1) The Patron;
(2) the Chancellor;.
(3) the Chairman;
(4) the President;
(5) the Deans;
(6) the Directors;
(7) the Chairmen of the Teaching
Departments;
(8) the Registrar;
(9) the Director of Finance;
(10) the Librarian;
(11) the Controller of
Examinations;
(12) the Resident Auditor; and
(13) such other persons as may be
prescribed to be the officers of the University.
